1
00:01:01,560 --> 00:01:06,200
Taming the Husband

2
00:01:06,440 --> 00:01:08,840
Episode 19

3
00:01:14,480 --> 00:01:17,520
Lady Lin really keeps her talents hidden.

4
00:01:19,920 --> 00:01:22,080
Her family was in the shipping trade, too.

5
00:01:22,960 --> 00:01:24,480
But business was so hard,

6
00:01:24,960 --> 00:01:28,480
that she had to marry into the Xies,
and when even that didn't save it,

7
00:01:28,960 --> 00:01:30,040
they let everyone go.

8
00:01:30,640 --> 00:01:32,000
But if this is so valuable,

9
00:01:32,120 --> 00:01:33,680
why didn't she give it to Heng?

10
00:01:34,320 --> 00:01:37,400
About what happened on the boat,
she asked me to keep it quiet

11
00:01:37,600 --> 00:01:39,160
so Heng wouldn't be implicated.

12
00:01:39,440 --> 00:01:40,440
There's a saying:

13
00:01:40,640 --> 00:01:43,520
"When parents love their children,
they look far ahead for them."

14
00:01:46,200 --> 00:01:47,560
I'm not so sure about that.

15
00:01:48,560 --> 00:01:49,920
Everyone says

16
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:52,880
Lady Zhou is meek,
so meek she must be stupid,

17
00:01:53,440 --> 00:01:54,840
but do you think she's stupid?

18
00:01:55,440 --> 00:01:58,560
People who know how to hide their talents
are usually quite clever.

19
00:01:58,640 --> 00:01:59,960
Exactly.

20
00:02:00,040 --> 00:02:01,280
If she's so clever,

21
00:02:01,360 --> 00:02:03,120
when the customers came to protest,

22
00:02:03,240 --> 00:02:06,240
why did she choose the solution
that would cost her the most?

23
00:02:07,880 --> 00:02:10,320
The more I think about it,
the stranger it seems.

24
00:02:13,920 --> 00:02:14,960
Baozhu,

25
00:02:17,120 --> 00:02:18,120
I'm a little tired.

26
00:02:47,760 --> 00:02:49,560
Why didn't you see your father off?

27
00:02:51,040 --> 00:02:54,760
Now that he's gone,
who knows when he'll be back?

28
00:02:57,480 --> 00:02:58,480
Mother,

29
00:03:00,160 --> 00:03:01,440
did I do the wrong thing?

30
00:03:03,640 --> 00:03:04,920
You did nothing wrong.

31
00:03:07,960 --> 00:03:09,360
But if it weren't for me,

32
00:03:11,720 --> 00:03:13,200
Father wouldn't be disgraced.

33
00:03:16,480 --> 00:03:18,240
If you wanted to keep it a secret,

34
00:03:18,640 --> 00:03:19,840
you shouldn't have done it.

35
00:03:21,440 --> 00:03:25,360
Remember, you don't have to carry

36
00:03:25,840 --> 00:03:27,760
the blame for someone else's mistakes.

37
00:03:28,840 --> 00:03:30,120
He'll hate me.

38
00:03:33,560 --> 00:03:35,240
I've let him down.

39
00:03:39,360 --> 00:03:40,440
Look at me.

40
00:03:41,320 --> 00:03:42,320
Look at me.

41
00:03:44,360 --> 00:03:45,680
What makes a person honorable?

42
00:03:46,880 --> 00:03:48,160
You respect what's right,

43
00:03:49,920 --> 00:03:51,480
know where to draw the line,

44
00:03:52,040 --> 00:03:55,520
and do your duty to your country
and to your family.

45
00:03:56,840 --> 00:03:58,360
That's your path.

46
00:03:59,560 --> 00:04:00,960
Don't torment yourself.

47
00:04:02,040 --> 00:04:04,880
I want you
to keep going without a second thought

48
00:04:05,600 --> 00:04:06,720
and never look back.

49
00:04:08,760 --> 00:04:09,760
My path?

50
00:04:11,280 --> 00:04:14,560
But the path I've been on
was wrong from the start.

51
00:04:15,320 --> 00:04:16,760
If Father knew,

52
00:04:16,840 --> 00:04:18,920
he'd be even more disappointed in me.

53
00:04:23,920 --> 00:04:24,920
Come with me.

54
00:04:38,400 --> 00:04:41,240
Your father put all of this aside for you,

55
00:04:42,760 --> 00:04:46,080
in case one day you wanted to marry
and had a use for it.

56
00:04:54,600 --> 00:04:56,080
But... When did he do this?

57
00:04:58,120 --> 00:05:00,240
He used to press you to marry a Huang,

58
00:05:00,600 --> 00:05:02,280
then he dropped the whole thing.

59
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:04,000
Can you guess why?

60
00:05:05,640 --> 00:05:06,640
He knew.

61
00:05:10,960 --> 00:05:13,560
But he said

62
00:05:16,120 --> 00:05:17,160
he was proud of me.

63
00:05:17,760 --> 00:05:19,400
Then he was proud of you.

64
00:05:20,480 --> 00:05:21,680
So, Heng,

65
00:05:22,280 --> 00:05:23,800
forget what anyone else thinks

66
00:05:24,360 --> 00:05:25,840
and go your own way.

67
00:05:31,600 --> 00:05:33,600
Does Jin Baozhu have heaven on her side?

68
00:05:34,920 --> 00:05:36,320
Heaven must be blind.

69
00:05:37,360 --> 00:05:39,600
I'd say it's Lady Zhou
we ought to be talking about.

70
00:05:40,440 --> 00:05:41,440
Zhou Wanjun

71
00:05:42,040 --> 00:05:44,280
All of Aunt Shen's shops
went back to the household,

72
00:05:44,360 --> 00:05:47,120
so who stands to gain the most
but the one who runs it?

73
00:05:47,760 --> 00:05:50,800
Isn't that how it's always been?
She gets rich without making a sound.

74
00:05:52,680 --> 00:05:53,960
We have to do something.

75
00:05:54,040 --> 00:05:56,680
-Forget it.
-With Yan and Baozhu in the way,

76
00:05:57,240 --> 00:05:58,600
no one can touch her.

77
00:06:32,560 --> 00:06:35,600
I want to talk to you about Lady Zhou.

78
00:06:48,880 --> 00:06:50,320
This brush isn't writing well.

79
00:06:50,400 --> 00:06:51,880
Get me a new one, would you?

80
00:06:58,400 --> 00:06:59,920
Dearest Qiao,

81
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:03,240
would you be so kind
as to fetch me a decent brush?

82
00:07:03,320 --> 00:07:04,800
I'd be ever so grateful.

83
00:07:05,800 --> 00:07:06,800
I heard you.

84
00:07:07,360 --> 00:07:08,600
Go on, then.

85
00:07:17,400 --> 00:07:18,400
What?

86
00:07:18,480 --> 00:07:20,080
Lady Zhou never fights for anything,

87
00:07:20,640 --> 00:07:22,000
yet everything goes her way.

88
00:07:22,080 --> 00:07:23,640
If that's a coincidence,
it's a little too convenient.

89
00:07:23,800 --> 00:07:25,600
So that thick skull of yours
finally had a thought.

90
00:07:25,680 --> 00:07:27,480
Too bad it's already too late.

91
00:07:30,920 --> 00:07:31,920
Then I'm leaving.

92
00:07:32,960 --> 00:07:35,880
Are you giving up already?
Won't you even try again?

93
00:07:36,840 --> 00:07:38,360
At least buy me a cup of tea.

94
00:07:39,560 --> 00:07:40,920
Let me take you somewhere.

95
00:07:41,880 --> 00:07:42,880
Xie Xi!

96
00:07:43,760 --> 00:07:45,120
Asking for a beating?

97
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:55,720
-Good!
-Good!

98
00:08:03,200 --> 00:08:04,400
No, thank you.

99
00:08:08,480 --> 00:08:09,720
His name is Shen Qinghe.

100
00:08:09,920 --> 00:08:11,160
He fled the Central Plains

101
00:08:11,800 --> 00:08:13,240
after a drought hit his family.

102
00:08:13,320 --> 00:08:14,680
They've had a terrible time.

103
00:08:16,880 --> 00:08:18,920
-You two know each other?
-Yes.

104
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:21,440
I come by now and then
to give him a bit of business,

105
00:08:21,520 --> 00:08:22,520
buy some tea and things.

106
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:25,400
Xie Xi, you're making a fool of me.

107
00:08:27,240 --> 00:08:28,520
I'm just helping someone out.

108
00:08:29,080 --> 00:08:31,760
Besides, isn't Biluochun
a Shuyu Terrace for women?

109
00:08:31,840 --> 00:08:34,600
With all sorts coming and going,
no one pays us any mind.

110
00:08:35,320 --> 00:08:38,440
What did you bring me here to tell me?
If you won't say it, I'm leaving.

111
00:08:38,520 --> 00:08:39,880
It reeks of powder in here.

112
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:43,120
Wait.

113
00:08:44,560 --> 00:08:45,720
You can go.

114
00:08:51,160 --> 00:08:53,600
We...
we think something's off with Lady Zhou.

115
00:08:53,680 --> 00:08:57,560
You want to look into Lady Zhou?
You're part of this family.

116
00:08:57,640 --> 00:08:59,240
Why help outsiders
dig up its dirty laundry?

117
00:08:59,320 --> 00:09:02,040
For all I know, you're trying to bait us.

118
00:09:03,320 --> 00:09:04,440
I've got my reasons.

119
00:09:04,520 --> 00:09:05,520
Why should I tell you?

120
00:09:06,280 --> 00:09:07,520
Then why should I trust you?

121
00:09:08,080 --> 00:09:09,400
Don't you already have dirt on me?

122
00:09:10,040 --> 00:09:11,080
What?

123
00:09:11,640 --> 00:09:13,640
If my husband found out
I'd set foot in a brothel,

124
00:09:13,720 --> 00:09:14,960
he'd eat me alive.

125
00:09:21,720 --> 00:09:23,960
Where have you been?
You disappeared all day

126
00:09:24,520 --> 00:09:26,240
and come home reeking of powder.

127
00:09:26,840 --> 00:09:29,200
-I was at the shop.
-I've already been there.

128
00:09:36,040 --> 00:09:37,360
Fine, I'll tell you the truth.

129
00:09:37,960 --> 00:09:39,040
I went shopping

130
00:09:39,160 --> 00:09:40,640
and stopped by a rouge shop.

131
00:09:41,200 --> 00:09:42,960
Why were you being so evasive, then?

132
00:09:43,600 --> 00:09:45,240
Is it really a rouge shop?

133
00:09:45,760 --> 00:09:47,640
I went with Xie Xi.

134
00:09:48,320 --> 00:09:50,120
You two never get along.

135
00:09:50,960 --> 00:09:53,760
She was showing off her new rouge.

136
00:09:53,840 --> 00:09:56,360
I said I wanted some,
but she said they only sell to regulars.

137
00:09:56,920 --> 00:09:59,480
That got under my skin,
so I dragged her to the rouge shop.

138
00:10:02,800 --> 00:10:03,840
Where's the rouge?

139
00:10:12,880 --> 00:10:13,880
Wait.

140
00:10:15,280 --> 00:10:18,360
My husband could find
a pea under the mattress and dig it out.

141
00:10:18,480 --> 00:10:20,160
With this smell all over you...

142
00:10:22,480 --> 00:10:25,280
Jin Baozhu,
since when are you afraid of anything?

143
00:10:25,680 --> 00:10:27,000
Since I married a firecracker.

144
00:10:34,960 --> 00:10:36,120
Here it is.

145
00:10:41,960 --> 00:10:42,960
Wait.

146
00:10:43,200 --> 00:10:44,440
This one's been used.

147
00:10:44,600 --> 00:10:45,720
So what?

148
00:10:45,800 --> 00:10:48,120
Does Xie Yan really have time
to pry it open and check?

149
00:10:48,640 --> 00:10:49,640
He'd do more than that.

150
00:10:50,200 --> 00:10:52,960
Knowing him, he'd go like this.

151
00:10:59,600 --> 00:11:00,600
Jianwei.

152
00:11:00,880 --> 00:11:01,880
Yes?

153
00:11:02,600 --> 00:11:06,280
Ask the shopkeeper tomorrow
if Lady Jin came by.

154
00:11:06,400 --> 00:11:07,400
If she did,

155
00:11:07,960 --> 00:11:11,040
buy every last pot of rouge
they have and bring it here.

156
00:11:11,120 --> 00:11:13,000
Yes.

157
00:11:14,000 --> 00:11:15,200
And if he catches us out?

158
00:11:15,760 --> 00:11:16,880
The spark will catch,

159
00:11:16,960 --> 00:11:18,400
set off the firecracker,

160
00:11:18,480 --> 00:11:19,760
and blow up all three of us.

161
00:11:21,320 --> 00:11:22,400
All right, all right.

162
00:11:22,480 --> 00:11:26,000
We'd better get to that shop now
and buy a new one. Go, go, go.

163
00:11:30,040 --> 00:11:31,200
Wash up before bed.

164
00:11:32,640 --> 00:11:33,880
Get rid of those clothes.

165
00:11:34,280 --> 00:11:35,280
They stink.

166
00:11:35,840 --> 00:11:37,000
Fine.

167
00:11:42,080 --> 00:11:44,320
Didn't you say, "Next time, I promise"?

168
00:11:46,400 --> 00:11:47,520
Look at you,

169
00:11:48,080 --> 00:11:49,280
you're drenched in sweat.

170
00:11:50,480 --> 00:11:51,880
Get some rest tonight,

171
00:11:52,600 --> 00:11:53,720
all right?

172
00:11:54,480 --> 00:11:55,480
All right.

173
00:11:56,160 --> 00:11:57,160
I'm off.

174
00:11:59,080 --> 00:12:00,200
Let's go.

175
00:12:14,840 --> 00:12:16,520
Don't be upset, Young Master Xie.

176
00:12:23,760 --> 00:12:26,600
She helped me get back on my feet,
but she doesn't want me.

177
00:12:26,760 --> 00:12:29,520
Didn't Lady Jin explain what happened?
She really did buy rouge.

178
00:12:30,080 --> 00:12:32,640
If she were being falsely accused,
she'd be furious by now.

179
00:12:32,880 --> 00:12:34,760
She feels guilty.
She's lying, Jianwei.

180
00:12:35,640 --> 00:12:36,640
She lied to me!

181
00:12:39,760 --> 00:12:41,680
But what right do I have to blame her?

182
00:12:41,920 --> 00:12:43,080
I'm nothing to look at,

183
00:12:43,360 --> 00:12:44,360
I'm difficult,

184
00:12:45,240 --> 00:12:46,440
and then there are my legs.

185
00:12:48,560 --> 00:12:51,800
There must be some misunderstanding.
We should find out what happened.

186
00:12:56,560 --> 00:12:57,560
You're right.

187
00:12:58,320 --> 00:12:59,880
I'd like to meet him anyway.

188
00:12:59,960 --> 00:13:02,280
Keep a close eye on things for me.

189
00:13:03,320 --> 00:13:04,760
Quiet virtue brings good fortune

190
00:13:04,880 --> 00:13:06,000
Lady Zhou,

191
00:13:06,080 --> 00:13:07,760
if I hadn't heard this today,

192
00:13:08,080 --> 00:13:09,560
you'd still be in the dark.

193
00:13:10,600 --> 00:13:11,920
You've always been

194
00:13:12,000 --> 00:13:14,640
so good to Young Master Xie,
yet Lady Jin goes around

195
00:13:14,720 --> 00:13:16,440
making all those wild accusations.

196
00:13:18,480 --> 00:13:20,560
We can't expect everything to go our way.

197
00:13:21,160 --> 00:13:22,160
Let her be.

198
00:13:22,240 --> 00:13:24,840
If she does go to Madam Zhan
and start spreading stories,

199
00:13:25,080 --> 00:13:26,440
will you let her do that, too?

200
00:13:27,080 --> 00:13:30,280
If she's capable of that,

201
00:13:31,040 --> 00:13:32,200
how could I stop her?

202
00:13:44,200 --> 00:13:46,240
-Mother.
-Where's Xi?

203
00:13:46,360 --> 00:13:48,720
All day long she's nowhere to be found.

204
00:13:49,920 --> 00:13:51,160
She wants a hairpin,

205
00:13:51,560 --> 00:13:53,600
so she's pestering the storeroom matron.

206
00:13:59,400 --> 00:14:01,160
It's my fault for losing my standing.

207
00:14:01,240 --> 00:14:02,440
In the old days,

208
00:14:03,200 --> 00:14:04,960
one word from me would have done it.

209
00:14:05,280 --> 00:14:07,560
Mother, if you want to regain some
respect,

210
00:14:08,200 --> 00:14:09,280
now's your chance.

211
00:14:10,480 --> 00:14:11,920
Just answer a few questions for me,

212
00:14:13,000 --> 00:14:14,280
and tell me the truth.

213
00:14:20,680 --> 00:14:22,160
What's Xi up to?

214
00:14:22,760 --> 00:14:25,400
She was ready to leave ages ago,
so why isn't she here yet?

215
00:14:29,680 --> 00:14:31,320
The tea seller isn't here either.

216
00:14:32,840 --> 00:14:33,840
I'm done waiting.

217
00:14:34,360 --> 00:14:36,520
I'll tell you, and you can tell her.

218
00:14:39,520 --> 00:14:41,240
The prescription for Xie Yan's powder

219
00:14:41,360 --> 00:14:43,960
was something my mother
learned from Lady Zhou,

220
00:14:44,160 --> 00:14:46,360
who knew about it
but never confronted her.

221
00:14:46,640 --> 00:14:47,720
That doesn't make sense.

222
00:14:48,320 --> 00:14:50,200
As for the plum drink and the blocks,

223
00:14:50,560 --> 00:14:53,560
Mother swears she didn't tamper with them.
She swore on her life.

224
00:14:54,680 --> 00:14:56,000
Learned it?

225
00:14:56,080 --> 00:14:57,280
She stole it, didn't she?

226
00:14:58,200 --> 00:14:59,200
Even so.

227
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:01,040
Put it this way.

228
00:15:01,600 --> 00:15:04,000
If a bandit slashes a thief,

229
00:15:04,080 --> 00:15:05,600
does that mean the thief deserved it?

230
00:15:11,360 --> 00:15:13,360
Or say someone robs the house next door.

231
00:15:14,040 --> 00:15:16,440
Can you assume he robbed that one, too?

232
00:15:17,360 --> 00:15:18,680
Of course not.

233
00:15:18,960 --> 00:15:21,240
But what if both houses
lost exactly the same things,

234
00:15:21,320 --> 00:15:23,040
and the thief left
exactly the same footprints?

235
00:15:23,600 --> 00:15:25,320
Maybe the second thief framed the first

236
00:15:25,640 --> 00:15:27,960
by wearing the same shoes as he did

237
00:15:28,040 --> 00:15:29,720
and stealing the same things.

238
00:15:29,920 --> 00:15:30,960
Don't try to fool me.

239
00:15:31,040 --> 00:15:32,400
What are the odds of that?

240
00:15:32,480 --> 00:15:34,040
That's exactly it.

241
00:15:34,320 --> 00:15:35,520
It had to be deliberate.

242
00:15:37,040 --> 00:15:39,200
Forget it.
You're not following anyway.

243
00:15:44,920 --> 00:15:48,080
The Xies have had their share of scandals,
but this one takes the cake.

244
00:15:48,560 --> 00:15:50,400
Flirt all you like outside,

245
00:15:50,480 --> 00:15:51,800
but why bring him home?

246
00:15:51,960 --> 00:15:53,400
What an idiot.

247
00:15:57,960 --> 00:16:00,400
This morning, Shen Qinghe brought this
to the Xie house,

248
00:16:00,560 --> 00:16:03,680
claiming Xi had taken him as her lover
and that he was to marry into our family.

249
00:16:03,760 --> 00:16:05,880
Lady Zhou barely managed to send him away.

250
00:16:05,960 --> 00:16:07,160
He demanded we give him an answer.

251
00:16:08,000 --> 00:16:10,400
One bloody handkerchief
doesn't prove anything.

252
00:16:10,960 --> 00:16:12,240
It's figured satin.

253
00:16:12,680 --> 00:16:15,760
Most people couldn't get hold of it.
And I recognize this handkerchief.

254
00:16:16,440 --> 00:16:17,600
I've seen her use it.

255
00:16:18,800 --> 00:16:19,920
Where's Xie Xi?

256
00:16:21,000 --> 00:16:24,800
Still kneeling in the ancestral hall.
Lady Zhou won't let anyone visit her.

257
00:16:31,520 --> 00:16:32,880
Can you climb through a window?

258
00:16:33,440 --> 00:16:34,880
That's against the family rules,

259
00:16:35,040 --> 00:16:36,240
and I don't even want to see her.

260
00:16:39,080 --> 00:16:45,760
The Xie family's ancestors
Virtue guides future generations

261
00:16:54,000 --> 00:16:55,160
Why are you here?

262
00:16:56,600 --> 00:16:57,880
Come to laugh at me?

263
00:16:57,960 --> 00:17:00,200
Of course not.
I need a favor from you,

264
00:17:00,280 --> 00:17:02,400
so how could I leave you to rot?
-I mean...

265
00:17:05,120 --> 00:17:06,200
That's not what he meant.

266
00:17:06,280 --> 00:17:08,440
He meant
we came because we're worried about you.

267
00:17:11,720 --> 00:17:12,920
Right, right.

268
00:17:13,000 --> 00:17:14,760
Did you really give him this?

269
00:17:16,520 --> 00:17:17,560
It's mine.

270
00:17:17,720 --> 00:17:19,720
What?
So you really did...

271
00:17:20,280 --> 00:17:22,280
I like to look
at a handsome man now and then.

272
00:17:22,560 --> 00:17:24,800
-You think I'd throw myself at anyone?
-You idiot.

273
00:17:25,200 --> 00:17:26,240
Go on.

274
00:17:26,320 --> 00:17:28,720
A while back, I saw a man in the street

275
00:17:28,880 --> 00:17:30,640
being picked on by a group of men,

276
00:17:30,720 --> 00:17:33,160
so I had the servants chase them off.

277
00:17:33,240 --> 00:17:36,320
He was quite handsome,
and he was covered in blood,

278
00:17:36,400 --> 00:17:38,960
so I took my handkerchief
and pressed it against his wound.

279
00:17:39,040 --> 00:17:40,960
He said he'd stained it

280
00:17:41,040 --> 00:17:42,880
and wanted to wash it and give it back.

281
00:17:42,960 --> 00:17:44,200
He lived nearby,

282
00:17:44,280 --> 00:17:45,640
so I went along with him.

283
00:17:55,840 --> 00:17:57,800
What do you do for a living?

284
00:17:58,440 --> 00:18:00,960
I sell tea by day and charm by night.

285
00:18:03,080 --> 00:18:06,600
You're perfectly able-bodied.
How did you end up doing that?

286
00:18:07,160 --> 00:18:10,360
The drought in the Central Plains
left my family without a crop,

287
00:18:11,200 --> 00:18:13,200
so I came to Yangzhou to make a living.

288
00:18:15,160 --> 00:18:16,320
What about your father?

289
00:18:16,560 --> 00:18:17,560
He gambles.

290
00:18:18,840 --> 00:18:19,840
Your mother?

291
00:18:20,720 --> 00:18:22,560
She's gravely ill.

292
00:18:24,200 --> 00:18:26,960
You must have other brothers and sisters.

293
00:18:27,040 --> 00:18:28,200
What about them?

294
00:18:28,720 --> 00:18:29,760
They're all in school.

295
00:18:33,560 --> 00:18:34,920
That's awful.

296
00:18:35,480 --> 00:18:38,440
Miss Xie, I'm only an entertainer.

297
00:18:46,040 --> 00:18:49,000
I didn't mean to look down on you.

298
00:18:50,280 --> 00:18:51,920
Why are you crying?

299
00:18:52,520 --> 00:18:54,400
I really didn't mean
to look down on you.

300
00:18:54,560 --> 00:18:56,960
Please don't be upset, all right?

301
00:18:57,920 --> 00:18:59,080
Don't cry.

302
00:19:00,840 --> 00:19:01,840
All right.

303
00:19:01,960 --> 00:19:04,520
How much is your tea per jin?
I'll take it all.

304
00:19:04,600 --> 00:19:07,240
-And then?
-Then I'd buy tea during the day

305
00:19:07,320 --> 00:19:09,360
and come drink it at night,
and he'd often tell me nice things

306
00:19:09,440 --> 00:19:11,360
to make me happy.
I was paying for it,

307
00:19:11,440 --> 00:19:13,400
so of course I felt fine about it.

308
00:19:13,480 --> 00:19:14,680
Then last night,

309
00:19:14,760 --> 00:19:17,000
I'd barely taken a sip when he asked me,

310
00:19:17,400 --> 00:19:19,000
"When are we getting married?"

311
00:19:19,320 --> 00:19:21,240
With a father who gambles,
a mother who needs treatment,

312
00:19:21,360 --> 00:19:24,040
and brothers to put through school,
who'd want to get mixed up in that?

313
00:19:24,160 --> 00:19:25,160
So I ran out of there.

314
00:19:25,720 --> 00:19:27,600
-And then he turned up here?
-Yes.

315
00:19:27,680 --> 00:19:29,880
And I just happened
to leave my handkerchief there

316
00:19:29,960 --> 00:19:31,600
when he just happened to propose.

317
00:19:31,680 --> 00:19:33,440
It was one coincidence after another!

318
00:19:33,840 --> 00:19:36,200
How did I get so unlucky?

319
00:19:36,800 --> 00:19:37,800
Wait.

320
00:19:38,560 --> 00:19:39,760
Something's off.

321
00:19:41,040 --> 00:19:44,360
The first time you went to Biluochun,
he called you Miss Xie.

322
00:19:44,640 --> 00:19:45,640
Did you tell him your name?

323
00:19:46,200 --> 00:19:47,960
No. Why would I?

324
00:19:51,080 --> 00:19:52,560
Then how did he know?

325
00:19:52,760 --> 00:19:54,720
Someone must have tipped him off
beforehand.

326
00:19:55,160 --> 00:19:58,040
I'd say
all those stories were lies to fool you.

327
00:19:59,680 --> 00:20:00,760
He lied to me?

328
00:20:02,600 --> 00:20:05,120
Do you remember the day
we were talking things over

329
00:20:05,200 --> 00:20:06,600
and Mingpei walked past?

330
00:20:07,280 --> 00:20:08,440
She heard the whole thing.

331
00:20:09,360 --> 00:20:10,560
She heard us,

332
00:20:10,760 --> 00:20:12,560
then went straight to Lady Zhou.

333
00:20:13,120 --> 00:20:15,600
Shen Qinghe came to make trouble
on Lady Zhou's orders.

334
00:20:15,680 --> 00:20:19,480
That's impossible.
That was after I'd already met him.

335
00:20:21,040 --> 00:20:23,240
Lady Zhou may have planted him

336
00:20:24,480 --> 00:20:25,640
for another purpose,

337
00:20:26,360 --> 00:20:29,000
but then she got nervous and had him

338
00:20:29,080 --> 00:20:31,280
make trouble ahead of time
so she could get to you.

339
00:20:32,880 --> 00:20:34,520
That's what you get for rescuing him.

340
00:20:35,320 --> 00:20:36,360
You're trying to scare me.

341
00:20:37,200 --> 00:20:38,600
Then go get him on our side.

342
00:20:38,840 --> 00:20:40,080
-Win him over.
-I...

343
00:20:40,160 --> 00:20:42,240
Then I'll have someone
to back up my story.

344
00:20:44,760 --> 00:20:45,960
I'll go see him.

345
00:21:20,760 --> 00:21:22,560
Young Master Xie. Young Master Xie!

346
00:21:22,640 --> 00:21:24,960
Lady Jin went out
dressed like that.

347
00:21:25,480 --> 00:21:26,480
I know.

348
00:21:27,080 --> 00:21:28,080
I saw her.

349
00:21:33,800 --> 00:21:36,320
Go and follow her.

350
00:21:36,760 --> 00:21:38,680
Me? I can't.

351
00:21:38,760 --> 00:21:40,040
I'll raise your wages.

352
00:21:42,920 --> 00:21:44,040
Yes.

353
00:21:59,120 --> 00:22:00,320
Young Master Xie.

354
00:22:01,680 --> 00:22:02,680
Well?

355
00:22:03,720 --> 00:22:05,560
Don't be angry, Young Master Xie.

356
00:22:07,360 --> 00:22:08,520
Tell me.

357
00:22:10,000 --> 00:22:13,240
Lady Jin went to see a man.

358
00:22:13,800 --> 00:22:16,280
He was fair and quite handsome.

359
00:22:16,480 --> 00:22:17,480
What?

360
00:22:21,160 --> 00:22:23,760
Account books

361
00:22:26,400 --> 00:22:27,640
What are you doing here?

362
00:22:27,720 --> 00:22:29,360
Didn't you ask me to go over the books?

363
00:22:31,960 --> 00:22:33,360
Account books

364
00:22:35,080 --> 00:22:36,360
Yan, where are you going?

365
00:22:38,560 --> 00:22:40,520
Chase her too hard,
and you'll only annoy her.

366
00:22:41,200 --> 00:22:43,880
You do know
how to play hard to get, don't you?

367
00:22:44,760 --> 00:22:46,480
You're too worried to think straight.

368
00:22:54,640 --> 00:22:56,720
It won't dry anytime soon.

369
00:22:57,080 --> 00:22:58,640
May I ask where you live, miss?

370
00:22:59,200 --> 00:23:01,320
I'll return it to you in person.

371
00:23:02,560 --> 00:23:03,720
My name is Bai Mudan.

372
00:23:04,200 --> 00:23:05,680
My brother is Bai Junmei.

373
00:23:05,960 --> 00:23:07,760
I'm sure you've heard of him.

374
00:23:08,600 --> 00:23:10,560
Mudan and Junmei...

375
00:23:11,600 --> 00:23:13,680
I take it you know your teas, miss.

376
00:23:15,520 --> 00:23:18,160
This tea was a gift.
I don't know what it is.

377
00:23:18,720 --> 00:23:20,840
Could you tell me, Miss Bai?

378
00:23:46,160 --> 00:23:48,600
Huiyuan old-bush Shuixian.
Very good.

379
00:24:07,880 --> 00:24:09,520
How does the paralyzing powder smell?

380
00:24:09,920 --> 00:24:14,080
Did you think
a change of clothes would fool me?

381
00:24:15,960 --> 00:24:17,400
What a pretty face.

382
00:24:18,200 --> 00:24:19,400
What a waste.

383
00:24:20,960 --> 00:24:24,040
I'll have my fun with you, then kill you

384
00:24:24,240 --> 00:24:25,720
and dump you behind the hill.

385
00:24:28,480 --> 00:24:29,840
You lying bastard.

386
00:24:31,880 --> 00:24:33,600
The Xie estate

387
00:24:35,440 --> 00:24:37,040
Stay still, stay still.
Just sit there.

388
00:24:38,960 --> 00:24:40,600
He's a jealous man,

389
00:24:41,160 --> 00:24:43,280
and if he sees two shadows
moving around in here,

390
00:24:43,360 --> 00:24:45,200
he'll imagine all sorts of things.

391
00:24:45,520 --> 00:24:47,440
You don't mean that, Lady Jin.

392
00:24:47,640 --> 00:24:50,240
Young Master Xie cares about you,
and usually, you...

393
00:24:50,320 --> 00:24:52,480
you, you... you're happy he does.

394
00:24:53,920 --> 00:24:56,120
If you ask me,
a man should be more generous.

395
00:24:56,200 --> 00:24:58,800
Look at him, getting jealous all the time.

396
00:24:58,880 --> 00:25:01,280
Doesn't he have anything else to do?
Don't you think so?

397
00:25:01,360 --> 00:25:03,080
I wouldn't say that.

398
00:25:03,640 --> 00:25:05,280
Young Master Xie is your husband,

399
00:25:05,920 --> 00:25:09,400
so it's only natural he'd ask after you.

400
00:25:09,480 --> 00:25:10,880
Why are you stammering?

401
00:25:19,360 --> 00:25:21,720
Are you tired? Go back to bed if you are.

402
00:25:22,280 --> 00:25:24,440
Tell you what, come see me later tomorrow.

403
00:25:28,600 --> 00:25:29,600
Go on.

404
00:25:55,760 --> 00:25:57,680
It's getting a little warm.

405
00:25:59,000 --> 00:26:00,640
I'll step out for some air.

406
00:26:01,400 --> 00:26:02,440
Jin Baozhu.

407
00:26:08,960 --> 00:26:09,960
What a coincidence.

408
00:26:10,040 --> 00:26:11,160
You're here, too?

409
00:26:12,200 --> 00:26:14,640
Did you get into the wrong bed?

410
00:26:14,720 --> 00:26:16,000
No coincidence.

411
00:26:16,720 --> 00:26:17,960
I was waiting here for you.

412
00:26:23,680 --> 00:26:27,400
We did have a proper wedding ceremony.

413
00:26:27,480 --> 00:26:29,320
Can't I get into your bed?

414
00:26:30,800 --> 00:26:33,520
I didn't bow to you at my wedding.
I bowed to a rooster.

415
00:26:40,120 --> 00:26:41,120
My leg hurts.

416
00:26:42,080 --> 00:26:43,720
Must be damp and rainy again.

417
00:26:43,880 --> 00:26:45,080
Drop the act.

418
00:26:45,400 --> 00:26:46,760
It's been sunny for days.

419
00:26:46,840 --> 00:26:48,280
There hasn't been a drop of rain.

420
00:26:50,680 --> 00:26:51,840
My left leg hurts, too.

421
00:26:56,800 --> 00:26:58,280
Stop making that noise.

422
00:27:13,840 --> 00:27:14,840
How is it?

423
00:27:17,640 --> 00:27:18,640
Pretty good.

424
00:27:18,720 --> 00:27:20,000
Compared to anyone else?

425
00:27:20,080 --> 00:27:21,400
There isn't anyone else.

426
00:27:21,480 --> 00:27:22,760
Then who was that man?

427
00:27:28,720 --> 00:27:30,640
Fine, I wasn't there at our wedding,

428
00:27:31,720 --> 00:27:33,160
I'm not very forgiving,

429
00:27:33,240 --> 00:27:34,560
and with my injured legs,
I may not look as good to you

430
00:27:34,640 --> 00:27:35,800
as some man out there.

431
00:27:35,880 --> 00:27:39,800
But we've got a marriage contract.
If I don't belong in your bed, does he?

432
00:27:42,680 --> 00:27:45,200
Tell me.
He's the man who sells tea to Xie Xi.

433
00:27:45,760 --> 00:27:47,000
He's having an affair with Xie Xi?

434
00:27:47,560 --> 00:27:49,560
No, wait.
Let me explain.

435
00:27:49,640 --> 00:27:50,800
I don't want to hear it.

436
00:27:53,840 --> 00:27:55,080
Don't think you can...

437
00:27:55,400 --> 00:27:57,360
You... Don't push your luck.

438
00:28:13,120 --> 00:28:14,120
Just this once.

439
00:28:15,440 --> 00:28:16,880
What did you think I was doing?

440
00:28:17,440 --> 00:28:19,240
I went there on business.

441
00:28:23,480 --> 00:28:25,920
She passed herself off as a noblewoman
to win Shen Qinghe over,

442
00:28:26,160 --> 00:28:27,720
but he saw right through her

443
00:28:28,080 --> 00:28:30,200
and turned the tables on her,
so she got hurt.

444
00:28:30,840 --> 00:28:32,680
How did she let him get the better of her?

445
00:28:32,880 --> 00:28:34,440
Maybe she doesn't want to help Xi.

446
00:28:35,040 --> 00:28:36,640
He slipped something in her tea.

447
00:28:37,400 --> 00:28:38,400
What a fool.

448
00:28:38,680 --> 00:28:40,320
She could've told me before she went.

449
00:28:42,560 --> 00:28:43,560
Qiao,

450
00:28:44,760 --> 00:28:47,840
you're not upset that she failed,
so what are you upset about?

451
00:28:49,360 --> 00:28:50,360
I...

452
00:28:52,120 --> 00:28:53,280
Look at me.

453
00:28:56,200 --> 00:28:57,800
Ever called Baozhu
your sister-in-law?

454
00:28:57,880 --> 00:28:59,400
Mother, don't read into it.

455
00:29:00,920 --> 00:29:02,000
I don't call her that

456
00:29:02,400 --> 00:29:04,920
because I don't think much of her
or accept her as family.

457
00:29:08,840 --> 00:29:10,080
Here.

458
00:29:10,160 --> 00:29:11,920
Take this to her in the morning.

459
00:29:12,000 --> 00:29:14,280
The sooner she uses it,
the sooner she'll heal.

460
00:29:14,520 --> 00:29:15,680
We don't owe her anything.

461
00:29:16,280 --> 00:29:17,400
Take it yourself, Mother.

462
00:29:18,280 --> 00:29:19,920
You silly child. How could I go out?

463
00:29:20,000 --> 00:29:21,360
I'm still confined to my room.

464
00:29:21,440 --> 00:29:24,200
What were you thinking?
You forget everything these days.

465
00:29:24,400 --> 00:29:25,400
Go.

466
00:29:27,120 --> 00:29:28,560
Xi's always getting into trouble.

467
00:29:29,120 --> 00:29:30,440
I'll have to think of something.

468
00:29:44,920 --> 00:29:46,520
It was just a few lackeys.

469
00:29:46,640 --> 00:29:48,400
We traded a couple of blows, that's all.

470
00:29:49,840 --> 00:29:52,920
You and Xie Xi never get along,
so why help her?

471
00:29:55,000 --> 00:29:56,080
I... Right.

472
00:29:56,840 --> 00:29:58,560
It's because we don't get along

473
00:29:58,960 --> 00:30:00,760
that I want to keep her down.

474
00:30:01,640 --> 00:30:02,640
Don't worry.

475
00:30:02,800 --> 00:30:03,800
I'll see to it

476
00:30:04,000 --> 00:30:05,320
they never get back up.

477
00:30:10,440 --> 00:30:11,440
Still hurts?

478
00:30:14,000 --> 00:30:15,120
I'll be gentler, then.

479
00:30:20,000 --> 00:30:23,560
The moon shines bright

480
00:30:33,600 --> 00:30:34,680
Jianwei.

481
00:30:39,520 --> 00:30:40,560
Yes, Young Master Xie?

482
00:30:40,640 --> 00:30:42,160
Take a message to Lu Ziyu.

483
00:30:42,760 --> 00:30:45,760
Tell him a tea seller at Biluochun
swindled Xie Xi out of her money.

484
00:30:46,320 --> 00:30:47,440
Yes.

485
00:31:10,720 --> 00:31:13,040
Wound-healing ointment
Directions for use

486
00:31:22,520 --> 00:31:26,400
For you

487
00:31:26,480 --> 00:31:27,720
She always attracts trouble.
